Enemy.

160
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:32,920
Enemy.

161
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:33,000
Enemy.

162
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:33,040
Enemy.

163
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:33,080
Enemy.

164
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,120
Enemy.

165
00:08:33,120 --> 00:08:33,560
Enemy.

166
00:08:33,560 --> 00:08:35,300
Our enemies are something called angels.

167
00:08:35,660 --> 00:08:37,080
They have the names of the angels too.

168
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,120
They are the targets of Eva and Nerve.

169
00:08:39,420 --> 00:08:41,560
This is our revenge for the death of Misaro's father.

170
00:08:41,560 --> 00:08:43,040
But why do I fight?

171
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:46,020
Why do I do this despite all the pain and suffering?

172
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,280
What are you, stupid?

173
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,040
An unknown enemy is attacking us.

174
00:08:50,060 --> 00:08:51,640
Of course we have to fight them.

175
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:53,760
Who cares what they think?

176
00:08:54,840 --> 00:08:57,620
Am I odd to try to find a reason to fight?

177
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,640
Am I not supposed to think about it?

178
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:00,500
Enemy.

179
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:01,120
Enemy.

180
00:09:01,120 --> 00:09:01,340
Enemy.

181
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:02,160
Enemy.

182
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:02,720
Enemy.

183
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,000
Enemy.

184
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:03,680
Enemy.

185
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,100
All are my enemies.

186
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:07,580
That which threatens us is the enemy.

187
00:09:07,940 --> 00:09:11,260
Of course, how can I be faulted for protecting my own life and those of others?

188
00:09:11,900 --> 00:09:12,400
Enemy.

189
00:09:12,400 --> 00:09:12,600
Enemy.

190
