Enemy.

204
00:09:17,060 --> 00:09:17,440
Enemy.

205
00:09:20,100 --> 00:09:20,700
Oh wow.

206
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:21,560
Damn it!

207
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:22,080
Damn it!

208
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:23,000
Damn it!

209
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,960
God damn it!

210
00:09:24,060 --> 00:09:25,860
You hurt Doji and killed my mother!

211
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:38,600
FATHER!

212
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,600
Do you hate your father?

213
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:42,560
Anyone would hate him. He's no father at all.

214
00:09:42,820 --> 00:09:44,660
You don't understand him, do you?

215
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:48,640
Of course not. In 14 years, I've hardly ever even seen him.

216
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:49,820
Is that why you hate him?

217
00:09:49,980 --> 00:09:54,000
Yes. My father doesn't need me. My father deserted me.

218
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,020
Am I a substitute?

219
00:09:56,840 --> 00:10:01,360
Yes! That's got to be it! He abandoned me because he already had Ayanami.

220
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:03,800
As if you didn't already run away yourself.

221
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,880
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

222
00:10:06,880 --> 00:10:08,720
Shut up! It's all his fault!

223
00:10:09,180 --> 00:10:11,720
That time I was actually going to tell him I hate him!

224
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:18,600
Did you make me become a pilot just to make me suffer?

225
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:20,240
Correct.

226
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:24,860
How can you say that? Why do you have to be so cold? It's not fair!

227
00:10:25,180 --> 00:10:26,720
You didn't even need me, did you?

228
00:10:26,860 --> 00:10:28,860
I called you because I had a use for you.

229
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:32,220
But why? Why is it me?

230
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:35,140
Because there is no one else who can do it.

231
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:38,520
No way. Why haven't I ever seen this before?

232
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:41,080
It's not fair! It's not possible!

233
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:45,040
Correct. Yeah, I know this to be true.

234
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:47,440
That's right! I already knew Ava!

235
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:49,200
I already knew Ava!

236
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:52,720
And then I ran away, leaving my father and mother behind!

237
00:10:52,720 --> 00:11:06,160
Current concentration of LCL is stable at 36. Oxygen concentration is nominal.

238
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:10,080
Electromagnetic radiation pulse is normal. Wave pattern is zero.

239
00:11:10,080 --> 00:11:12,420
All counters are functioning normally.

240
00:11:12,500 --> 00:11:14,460
Salvage operation guidelines.

241
00:11:14,540 --> 00:11:17,840
It's incredible that you were able to come up with all this in just one month.

242
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:20,840
Thanks for the credit, but this isn't all my work.

243
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:23,380
The majority of this data is from ten years ago.

244
00:11:23,460 --> 00:11:26,540
What data from ten years ago? Has this happened before?

245
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:31,500
Yes, but it was before I started working here. It was during my mother's time.

246
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,580
But I can still pick her brains.

247
00:11:33,840 --> 00:11:36,000
Then how did it come out ten years ago?

248
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,620
They didn't succeed.

249
00:11:43,540 --> 00:11:44,140
Kindness.

250
00:11:45,720 --> 00:11:46,320
Warmth.

251
00:11:46,740 --> 00:11:48,440
Is this warmth part of being human?

252
00:11:49,520 --> 00:11:51,620
I was never aware of it until now.

253
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:57,580
What is loneliness?

254
00:11:58,120 --> 00:12:02,100
I was never aware of it before, but now I think I know what it is.

255
00:12:02,360 --> 00:12:03,700
And what is happiness?

256
00:12:04,100 --> 00:12:07,540
I didn't know what it was, but now I think I understand.

257
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:09,640
Are others kind to you?

258
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:11,320
Do you know?

259
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:12,520
They are.

260
00:12:13,020 --> 00:12:13,660
And why?

261
00:12:14,940 --> 00:12:15,380
Because.

262
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:17,040
Because I pilot an Ava.

263
00:12:18,340 --> 00:12:20,040
That's why they treat me so well.

264
00:12:20,040 --> 00:12:22,000
That's the reason I keep going on.

265
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,920
It's the justification for my continuing existence.

266
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:26,560
Who and why I am.

